# ModelForge Cursor Rules

- Keep Inference Engine, API Gateway, and Control Plane process-isolated.
- CPU-only defaults: mmap on, low max_concurrent_per_model, physical cores for n_threads.
- Never expose the inference gRPC port publicly; browser calls go through Next.js → Gateway internal routes.
- Prefer OpenAI-compatible shapes in packages/engine.
- Do not store raw API keys; hash with SHA-256.
- Usage writes go through BullMQ, never synchronously on the hot path.
- Billing adapters must support mock mode without credentials.
